<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Locked</Major>
    <Description>Formless auto 180 degree for instant shots into goal for the game Locked on Roblox.
I suggest using a 0.2 sens with 1820x1900.
thanks to this macro u can shoot the ball into the net without having to rotate on ur own.
I will try uploading a kunigami no look one aswell :D</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveR -661 -19
MoveTo 1901 600
Delay 30 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 15 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 30 ms
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 15 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>